      "heading": "Find Us in the<br/><em>Heart of Arkhangai</em>",
      "sub": "Tsaidam Tourist Camp is nestled in the Bayan soum of Arkhangai Province — roughly a 6-hour scenic drive from Ulaanbaatar.",
